OL,3,GNEWSAThe saga of a missing football
OL,4,Aplaque's return home after crossing
OL,5,AEurope
OL,6,
OL,7,FA plaque of the Coventry City Football
OL,8,FClub crest is back in the team's home
OL,9,Fcity, after a shadowy tale involving
OL,10,FManchester City supporters, a tie clip,
OL,11,Fa Norwegian pub and a 22-year absence.
OL,13,FIt all started when Manchester City
OL,14,Flost 4-3 at Highfield Road in 2001 and
OL,15,Ffour visiting supporters swiped the
OL,16,Femblem from a restaurant and took it
OL,17,Fnorth with them.
OL,19,FBut not for long, because three years
OL,20,Flater, it somehow surfaced in an expat
OL,21,Fbar in Norway, where Coventry fan Steve
OL,22,FWalker saved it from being thrown out.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
