OL,3,GNEWSAThe saga of a missing football
OL,4,Aplaque's return home after crossing
OL,5,AEurope
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow, two decades after the Mancunians
OL,8,F"liberated" the plaque from Coventry -
OL,9,Fand a journey of more than 1,200 miles
OL,10,F- the sign is back in its home city.
